  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Support the Capacity-building of National Stakeholders and the Access to Protection for Vulnerable Migrants in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following accomplishments and identified needs across the country and considering the lessons learned and main achievements of the RDPP-NA 2019-2020, IOM is proposing to reach a wider scope of target audience through its capacity building, awareness raising and direct assistance programs. The main outcome is to support the national authorities and relevant stakeholders to meet their national and international commitments in combating trafficking in persons and migrant smuggling. Proposed activities, in particular capacity building trainings and workshops, will ensure long term effective and sustainable protection by strengthening the skills and knowledge of relevant stakeholders on identification strategies, referral pathway mechanisms and assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
